    "title": "Modular Generative Rack",
    "author": "groovy",
    "description": "Generative = Clock samples noise (S&H) into a minor Quantizer so pitch chooses itself. Minimal Rival Consoles-leaning pulse: warm sine bass + filtered triangle lead, soft gates, room reverb. Steer BPM, seed, filter LFO \u2014 re-render. No models.",
